1** |\n  | `r1335_N3c_win_giu_argv0_goc` | **OK giet 1/1** | (chưa có) |\n  | `r1335_F2_win_path_theo_cwd_launcher` | **OK giet 1/1** | (chưa có) |\n\n  Runner trả `(0, 2)` trên HEAD và `(2, 0)` trên BASE. Hai ca đích qua 1/1 trên cả hai vế (`--lap-ca`). Cây sạch sau khi chạy.\n- **N3:** ruff `--select F` delta 0 (5 F841 = 5); `adr-song` và `doctrine-scan` rc 0.\n- **N4** chỉ đo được sau merge: lane `launcher (windows-latest)` phải không còn dòng `SAI` nào cho `r1335_*`.\n\n---\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_015GtxrZk6gmfQKo7g4BfMBS)_","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-17T03:45:45Z","updated_at":"2026-11-17T04:20:14Z","closed_at":"2026-11-17T04:20:14Z","merged_at":"2026-11-17T04:20:14Z","merge_commit_sha":"0f037f75bc8d24e8004faee7565d8452e00a19a2","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"ducthangho:agent/wp1356-g1-claude","ref":"agent/wp1356-g1-claude","repo":{"id":1289195917,"node_id":"R_kgDOTNeRjQ","name":"tra-luat","full_name":"ducthangho/tra-luat","owner":{"login":"ducthangho","id":12748935,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzQ4OTM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12748935?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ducthangho","html_url":"https://github.com/ducthangho","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ducthangho/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ducthangho/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ducthangho/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ducthangho/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ducthangho/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ducthangho/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ducthangho/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ducthangho/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ducthangho/received_even